  "article": {
    "images": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "An old street in Shanghai has become a new hotspot. Artists have "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " buildings along Middle Fangbang Road with colourful images of cats, creating a unique outdoor gallery."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "All of the pictures are based on real cats raised by Chinese netizens. Artists also painted the cats’ names and their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "profiles",
            "ref": "v-profile"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the walls "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their images. The cat street has "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " both local "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "residents",
            "ref": "v-resident"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and tourists alike. Many visitors even brought their pet cats along with them to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Some people walk slowly along the street, looking at each cat picture carefully."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These creative works were created by artist Tango and his team. They are part of the third Bund Art Season festival."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The “cat street” is about 600 metres long. It had been empty and quiet "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 2018. Now these lovely cat images are attracting people to make their way down it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They can take a look at the traditional buildings before these old buildings "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the future."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Tango’s team saw the empty street as a great outdoor gallery. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the “cat street”, the team also provided many other art "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "installations",
            "zh": "装置"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Yu Garden and BFC. Visitors can find cat "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "elements",
            "ref": "v-element"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in them too."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“They are a whole series of "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This area "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reflects",
            "ref": "v-reflect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "humanistic care",
            "zh": "人文关怀"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for cats and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "symbiotic relationship",
            "zh": "共生关系"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between cats and people in the city,” Tango said. The project shows how art can bring "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to old places."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
